EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}What, you again, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
How many times has it BEEN
today, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿Tú otra vez, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ya sabes que me gusta charlar
contigo, pero...
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Así no podré cotillear sobre ti...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}digo...{{TAG:0007:0000:12000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡decirle a todo el mundo
lo maravillos{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} que eres!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ne, yine sen mi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bugün KAÇINCI karşılaşmamız bu,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hello again, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
I'm always glad to talk with you.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Even this much, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tekrar merhaba, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
Seninle konuşmak her zaman hoşuma gider.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bu kadar sık olsa bile, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
